'''''Euphorbia kamponii''''' is a species of [[plant]] in the family [[Euphorbiaceae]]. It is [[Endemism|endemic]] to [[Madagascar]].  Its natural [[habitat]]s are subtropical or tropical dry [[forest]]s and subtropical or tropical dry [[shrubland]]. It is threatened by [[habitat loss]].

